  "facilitiesGuide.automations.step1Action": "点击「新建自动化」打开编辑器。",
  "facilitiesGuide.automations.step1Link": "打开自动化设置",
  "facilitiesGuide.automations.step2Title": "选择触发方式",
  "facilitiesGuide.automations.step2Description":
    "设置执行周期和时区；服务器会保存计划，刷新页面后仍然有效。",
  "facilitiesGuide.automations.step2Action": "填写触发周期和时区。",
  "facilitiesGuide.automations.step3Title": "检查执行上下文",
